# env.local — Environment Binding (PRIVATE, NOT COMMITTED)

This file captures the local environment bindings for this workspace.
Values here are REAL; this file is excluded from version control.

Copy `env.local.template` (if one exists) or create this file manually.

## JDK

JDK_PATH = <your-jdk-path>

## Database

DB_HOST = <your-db-host>
DB_PORT = <your-db-port>
DB_SCHEMA = <your-db-schema>
DB_USER = <your-db-user>
DB_PASSWORD =

## Server directories

GAME_SERVER_DIR = <your-game-server-dir>
LOGIN_SERVER_DIR = <your-login-server-dir>
LIBS_DIR = <your-libs-dir>

## Game Server identity

SERVER_NAME = <your-server-name>
SERVER_ID = <your-server-id>
LOGIN_PORT = <your-login-port>
GAME_PORT = <your-game-port>

## GM identity

GM_CHAR_NAME = <your-gm-character-name>
GM_CHAR_ID = <your-gm-character-id>